{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1119081429"}, "name":{"label":"Spooky.exe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-26T17:13:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.28.0"}, "id":{"label":"14597531741"}, "title":{"label":"DOESNT WORK ON SOME PHONES"}, "content":{"label":"I got this app because it’s super super fun and I really like the activities and quizzes. Only issue is once I bought a years worth of the subscription, half of the text wouldn’t show up on my partners side AT ALL (he has a Motorola). It made the app and subscription useless since the whole point was to do it long distance and in our own time but he couldn’t read the last half of all the questions or even the quiz name. I tried getting a refund for the months I haven’t used and it was denied even though I had evidence of the apps issues. Disappointing and a complete waste of money 💔 I would’ve loved to continue using this app and rebought the subscription if they fixed the issues otherwise and cancelled the months where it didn’t work.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
